WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:16.619
I sat frozen on the couch, waiting to hear what Mom had to say.

2
00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:21.712
"I remember saying that I would have to rob a bank," she began.

3
00:00:21.713 --> 00:00:26.163
"I was talking to Mrs. Hill, the real estate agent."

4
00:00:26.164 --> 00:00:29.589
"What's a real estate agent?" I asked.

5
00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:33.802
"Someone who sells apartments," Mom explained.

6
00:00:33.803 --> 00:00:37.893
"She told me about an apartment that costs a million dollars.

7
00:00:37.894 --> 00:00:41.695
I told her I'd have to rob a bank to get that much money.

8
00:00:41.696 --> 00:00:43.919
But I was only joking!"

9
00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:49.948
"See?" Tate said. "You made it all up, Iggy."

10
00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:52.814
"To tell you the truth," said Mom.

11
00:00:52.815 --> 00:00:55.822
"I have been looking for a new apartment."

12
00:00:55.823 --> 00:00:59.863
"Why?" I asked. "I like it here!"

13
00:00:59.864 --> 00:01:04.184
"Me too," said Tate. Then he glanced at me.

14
00:01:04.185 --> 00:01:08.354
"Except that I have to share a room with him."

15
00:01:08.355 --> 00:01:12.083
"You'll just have to keep sharing," Mom said.

16
00:01:12.084 --> 00:01:16.784
"I don't have enough money to buy a bigger apartment."

17
00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:19.048
I felt a lot better now.

18
00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:22.776
I had never really believed that Mom would rob a bank.

19
00:01:22.777 --> 00:01:25.464
But it was nice to know for sure.

20
00:01:25.465 --> 00:01:31.181
"Let's celebrate Jenny's prize and order pizza for everyone," Mom said.

21
00:01:31.182 --> 00:01:38.491
Josh, Jenny, and Molly came over.

22
00:01:38.492 --> 00:01:43.254
We were finishing our pizza when Molly's mom rushed into our apartment.

23
00:01:43.255 --> 00:01:46.998
"Caswell is missing again!" she cried.

24
00:01:46.999 --> 00:01:54.502
"The bell," I thought. If only I hadn't lost it!

25
00:01:54.503 --> 00:01:57.043
We all started looking for Caswell.

26
00:01:57.044 --> 00:01:59.749
"Caswell!"

27
00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:03.016
"Where are you?"

28
00:02:03.017 --> 00:02:07.596
We looked all around the building and in the backyard.

29
00:02:07.597 --> 00:02:12.644
A few of us walked around the block, looking for him too.

30
00:02:12.645 --> 00:02:18.981
Soon it was dark out, and Mrs. O'Donnell was very worried.

31
00:02:18.982 --> 00:02:22.208
"Maybe I should call the police," she said.

32
00:02:22.209 --> 00:02:24.406
We headed back upstairs.

33
00:02:24.407 --> 00:02:28.736
That was when I heard the sound.

34
00:02:28.737 --> 00:02:33.494
In the hallway outside my apartment, a bell tinkled.

35
00:02:33.495 --> 00:02:39.424
"My bell!" I cried. "The one I got for Caswell!"

36
00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:43.113
We went inside and followed the sound to our kitchen.

37
00:02:43.114 --> 00:02:46.081
"I hear the bell," Molly said.

38
00:02:46.082 --> 00:02:49.580
"But where's Caswell?"

39
00:02:49.581 --> 00:02:54.489
I went over to the wall behind the table.

40
00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:57.181
"The sound is coming from here!"

41
00:02:57.182 --> 00:03:01.300
"Caswell, is that you?" yelled Molly.

42
00:03:01.301 --> 00:03:04.394
"Yes!" Caswell called back.

43
00:03:04.395 --> 00:03:07.494
"And I found a really cool place!"

44
00:03:07.495 --> 00:03:13.507
"How did he get in the wall?" asked Josh.

45
00:03:13.508 --> 00:03:19.624
"Look!" said Jenny. "There's a little door in the wall!"

46
00:03:19.625 --> 00:03:21.607
Jenny was right.

47
00:03:21.608 --> 00:03:23.714
There was a door.

48
00:03:23.715 --> 00:03:26.381
I had never noticed it before.

49
00:03:26.382 --> 00:03:29.318
Tate helped us move the table.

50
00:03:29.319 --> 00:03:35.001
Then Mr. Calabria came upstairs and pried open the door.

51
00:03:35.002 --> 00:03:38.369
There was Caswell, inside a tiny room.

52
00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:42.614
And he was wearing my bell!

53
00:03:42.615 --> 00:03:48.139
"Caswell! I'm so happy to see you!" cried his mom.

54
00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:51.715
"How did you get that bell?" I asked.

55
00:03:51.716 --> 00:03:58.219
"I found it on the stairs," said Caswell. "It's treasure!"

56
00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:01.547
"It helped us find you!" I said.

57
00:04:01.548 --> 00:04:07.132
"Iggy, that bell is an amazing invention!" said Mom, hugging me.

58
00:04:07.133 --> 00:04:11.562
"It's the best invention in the world!" cried Josh.

59
00:04:11.563 --> 00:04:15.375
"It certainly is!" said Molly's mom.

60
00:04:15.376 --> 00:04:20.488
My mom was looking around inside the little room.

61
00:04:20.489 --> 00:04:22.855
It had two doors.

62
00:04:22.856 --> 00:04:25.784
One opened up to our kitchen.

63
00:04:25.785 --> 00:04:29.091
The other door opened to the hallway.

64
00:04:29.092 --> 00:04:33.302
That's how Caswell had gotten inside.

65
00:04:33.303 --> 00:04:35.542
Mom looked thoughtful.

66
00:04:35.543 --> 00:04:41.415
"I wonder if we could turn this space into a little bedroom for Iggy," she said.

67
00:04:41.416 --> 00:04:45.120
Mr. Calabria nodded, still looking around.

68
00:04:45.121 --> 00:04:48.414
"I think we could turn this into a bedroom."

69
00:04:48.415 --> 00:04:51.886
"That would be great!" exclaimed Tate.

70
00:04:51.887 --> 00:04:54.614
"I could have a room of my own!"

71
00:04:54.615 --> 00:04:58.620
"Me too!" I was grinning from ear to ear.

72
00:04:58.621 --> 00:05:02.854
No one needed a magic thinking box to know what I was thinking.

73
00:05:02.855 --> 00:05:11.248
I was thinking about all the incredible things I could invent in my new room!
